{"id": "86304", "name": "הפרדת משתנים – x·y′ + bx + a = 0, פתרון כללי (ב) (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Solve the following differential equation:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}\\frac{dy}{d{{CT:0}}} + {{CT:1}}{{CT:0}}+{{CT:2}} = 0. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>Use the letter \"c\" (small case) to denote the arbitrary constant occuring in the general solution.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(y({{CT:0}})\\) = [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> the equation is separable: isolate \\(dy\\), integrate both sides, and add one arbitrary constant.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — Separating the variables</b><br>For the equation<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}\\frac{dy}{d{{CT:0}}} + {{CT:1}}{{CT:0}}+{{CT:2}} = 0 \\]</p>rearranging gives<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ dy = \\frac{(-{{CT:1}}{{CT:0}}-{{CT:2}})}{{CT:0}}d{{CT:0}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Integrating both sides</b><br>Therefore<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int dy = \\int\\frac{(-{{CT:1}}{{CT:0}}-{{CT:2}})}{{CT:0}}d{{CT:0}} =\\int(-{{CT:1}}-\\frac{{CT:2}}{{CT:0}})d{{CT:0}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 3 — The general solution</b><br>Hence<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ y = {{CT:3}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "diff", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 2, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "diff(ans1,x)", "tans": "fans", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Your answer may satisfy the differential equation, but either is mathematically incorrect (look especially at the integral of 1/f(x)), has no constant or has used a different constant than \"c\".</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["correctanswer", "fans", "n1", "n2", "v", "wronganswer"], "nvariants": 48}